            "heading": "Affiliate Program Terms",
            "anchor": "affiliate-terms",
            "body": "<h3>2.1 Agreement and Eligibility</h3><p>By applying to, accepting an invitation to, participating in, or promoting Panquire through the Affiliate Program, you agree to these Affiliate Program Terms, the applicable Shopify Collabs terms and policies, and all applicable laws and platform rules.</p><p>You must provide accurate and current information about yourself, your business, your websites, your social-media accounts, and your promotional channels.</p><p>You may not apply using another person’s identity or represent that you have a relationship with Panquire that has not been authorized.</p><p>Participation is subject to Panquire’s approval.</p><h3>2.2 Commission Rate</h3><p>The standard commission rate is:</p><p><strong>5% of the eligible commission base</strong></p><p>The applicable rate may vary by:</p><ul><li>Product</li><li>Collection</li><li>Campaign</li><li>Promotional period</li><li>Affiliate</li><li>Discount code</li><li>Customer location</li><li>Special written agreement</li></ul><p>The current rate and applicable program details are shown in Shopify Collabs or in a separate written agreement with Panquire.</p><p>Panquire may change commission rates for future referrals by providing notice through Shopify Collabs or another reasonable method. A rate change will not affect commissions that were already validly earned before the effective date of the change, except where adjustment is required because of cancellation, refund, fraud, chargeback, or another permitted reversal.</p><h3>2.3 Qualifying Purchases</h3><p>A qualifying purchase generally means a purchase that:</p><ol><li>Is made through an eligible Panquire store or sales channel;</li><li>Is attributed to your approved affiliate link or discount code through Shopify Collabs;</li><li>Is completed and paid for by the customer;</li><li>Is not canceled, returned, refunded, disputed, fraudulent, or subject to a chargeback; and</li><li>Otherwise satisfies the applicable Program Terms.</li></ol><p>Unless stated otherwise, commissions may be calculated on the eligible product subtotal after discounts and before taxes, shipping charges, customs duties, payment-processing fees, and other excluded amounts.</p><p>The applicable commission base and exclusions will be shown in Shopify Collabs or provided by Panquire.</p><p>The following may be excluded from commissions:</p><ul><li>Taxes</li><li>Shipping charges</li><li>Customs duties and import fees</li><li>Gift cards</li><li>Canceled orders</li><li>Fully or partially refunded orders</li><li>Returned Products</li><li>Chargebacks</li><li>Fraudulent or suspicious transactions</li><li>Orders placed by affiliates for themselves</li><li>Orders that do not meet program or attribution requirements</li><li>Orders excluded under a campaign or product-specific offer</li></ul><h3>2.4 Affiliate Attribution</h3><p>Affiliate attribution is determined using Shopify Collabs and its applicable tracking systems.</p><p>A commission may not be recorded if:</p><ul><li>The customer does not use your link or code;</li><li>Tracking is blocked or deleted;</li><li>The order is placed through an excluded channel;</li><li>Another affiliate receives attribution under the applicable program rules;</li><li>The customer uses an unauthorized or expired code;</li><li>The order is canceled, returned, refunded, disputed, or fraudulent; or</li><li>The transaction otherwise fails to qualify.</li></ul><p>Shopify Collabs reporting and Panquire’s transaction records will generally control commission calculations, subject to correction of demonstrated errors.</p><h3>2.5 Pending Commissions and Payment</h3><p>Commissions may remain pending for a holding period to allow time for cancellations, refunds, returns, chargebacks, fraud reviews, and payment disputes.</p><p>The applicable holding period is the period displayed in Shopify Collabs or otherwise communicated by Panquire. Shopify currently allows merchants to configure a holding period within a range that may be <strong>1–90 days</strong>, subject to Shopify’s then-current tools and policies.</p><p>During the holding period:</p><ul><li>Canceled and fully refunded orders may be removed automatically;</li><li>Panquire may dispute suspicious or improperly attributed commissions;</li><li>A commission may be adjusted if the underlying transaction changes; and</li><li>The commission is not yet considered finally approved.</li></ul><p>Payments are handled through the payment workflow and payment methods enabled for the program through Shopify Collabs.</p><p>Panquire is responsible for approved commissions owed under the Affiliate Program. Shopify Collabs provides platform and payment functionality but is not the party responsible for Panquire’s commission obligations under the Affiliate Program.</p><p>You may need to:</p><ul><li>Maintain an active Shopify Collabs account;</li><li>Complete required payout information;</li><li>Provide tax forms or identity information;</li><li>Satisfy payment-provider requirements.</li></ul>",
            "button": "",
            "link": ""
          }
        },
        "item3": {
