            "heading": "Corporate Purchase",
            "anchor": "corporate-purchase",
            "body": "<h3>Target Customers</h3><p>Mainly designed for business customers with bulk purchase needs, including dealers, rental businesses, outdoor camps, event organizers, riding clubs, and group buyers. For customers needing to purchase electric dirt bike models in bulk, a corporate purchase is a more suitable option.</p><h3>Bulk Purchasing Benefits</h3><p>Compared with buying a single unit, bulk purchasing electric dirt bike models is more suitable for business operations. Business customers can plan model combinations based on different rider ages, use scenarios, and budgets, helping better support rental, resale, outdoor activity, or group riding projects.</p><h3>Multiple-Unit Purchasing</h3><p>Suitable purchase solutions can be provided based on the customer’s order quantity, target models, inventory status, and delivery location. Whether it is a small trial order or a larger-scale purchase, customers can contact the team for further discussion.</p><h3>Manufacturer Sourcing</h3><p>Suitable purchase solutions can be provided based on the customer’s order quantity, target models, inventory status, and delivery location. Whether it is a small trial order or a larger-scale purchase, customers can contact the team for further discussion.</p><h3>Dealer Cooperation</h3><p>Dealers, resellers, and local partners are welcome to cooperate, helping customers expand their electric dirt bike product lineup and receive support that better fits business purchase needs.</p><h3>Exclusive Pricing</h3><p>A quote will be provided for business customers based on purchase quantity, target models, inventory status, and delivery location. The clearer the purchase information, the more accurate the quote will be.</p><h3>Shipping &amp; After-Sales Support</h3><p>Shipping arrangement information can be provided based on the order situation, along with product usage guidance, warranty service, and after-sales support information.</p><h3>Purchase Process</h3><p>Customers can contact the business team and provide their company name, business type, target electric dirt bike models, estimated purchase quantity, delivery location, and other requirements. The team will provide a suitable solution based on your purchasing goals.</p>",
            "button": "Contact the business team",
            "link": "/pages/contact"
          }
        }
